	//    - Do not set both **memberId** and **teamId** in the same **grantee** object. Instead, choose one based on the target of the grant.
	//
	//      - Retrieve the **memberId** by calling the [/v2/members](https://help.sigmacomputing.com/reference/list-members) endpoint.
	//      - Retrieve the **teamId** by calling the [/v2/teams](https://help.sigmacomputing.com/reference/list-teams) endpoint.
	//    - Grant permissions on a specific version tag of a report by specifying the **tagId**. Retrieve the **tagId** by calling the [/v2/tags](https://help.sigmacomputing.com/reference/list-version-tag) endpoint and using the `versionTagId` in the response.
	//
	//    ### Usage scenarios
	//
	//    - **Team collaboration**: Granting edit permissions to a team for collaborative work on a project.
